Overview
Welcome to Recovery Track! This guide will walk you through setting up your account and getting started with the platform.


Step 1: Log Into Your Account
Navigate to the login page
Enter your email and password
Click Log In
If you forgot your password, use the “Forgot Password” option. 


Step 2: Set Up Your Organization
Go to Settings
Add your organization details
Configure basic preferences

Step 3: Add Staff Members
Navigate to the Users or Team section
Click “Add User”
Assign roles (Admin or Staff)
Send invitations

Step 4: Add Your First Client
Go to the Clients section
Click “Add New Client”
Enter required information
Click Save

Step 5: Schedule Appointments
Navigate to Appointments
Click “Create Appointment”
Select client, date, and time
Save the appointment

Step 6: Add Notes & Track Progress
Open a client profile
Add notes or updates
Track progress over time

Tips for Success
Ensure all staff have correct roles assigned
Keep client records up to date
Use notes regularly for tracking progress

Need Help?
If you run into any issues, contact support, we’re happy to assist you.
